PancakeSwap CAKE holders on opBNB have four weeks to move their tokens

@PancakeSwap is warning $CAKE holders on opBNB to bridge out before Nov 23 at 00:00 UTC, when the LayerZero-powered route out of the network stops working. @LayerZero_Core is ending the services that check and deliver cross-chain transfers for opBNB. LayerZero has wound down its default bridging services on several chains this year.

Holders can move their CAKE through PancakeSwap’s official bridge page. PancakeSwap also said it will never DM users to offer help or ask for seed phrases.

